UR5 VLA complete guide

Operational code derived from physical-ur5-vla-implementation, including
ur5_vla_dataset_recorder (package metadata declares Apache-2.0).
Original project: https://github.com/jawads12/physical-ur5-vla-implementation

The vendored LeRobot source is from Hugging Face LeRobot, Apache-2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot
Vendor license and original source headers are retained in dump/vla_script_training/lerobot.
